        <div class="space-y-12">
            <header>
                <h2 class="h2default mb-2">List of BDCB Licensees</h2>
                <p>Here is the list of BDCB licensees according to BDCB's laws and regulations.</p>
            </header>
            <section class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-y-12 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:gap-8 md:gap-12 lg:grid-cols-4">
                
